-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THIRD-PARTY SOURCE CODE NOTICE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project (mc-developing-mcp) is a query tool and indexing system. It
builds SQLite databases from publicly available Java source code for the
purpose of enabling AI-assisted Minecraft mod development. The databases
distributed with this project contain indexed metadata (class names, method
signatures, field names, documentation text) derived from the following
projects, each of which retains full copyright and all rights reserved by
their respective owners.

ALL RIGHTS TO THE FOLLOWING SOURCE CODES AND THEIR DERIVATIVES ARE RESERVED
BY THEIR RESPECTIVE OWNERS. This project makes no claim of ownership over any
third-party source code, asset, or intellectual property listed below.

See NOTICE for the complete list of third-party projects and their licenses.
